    "every omission has a reason and evidence",
    "every covered seam maps to exactly one valid capsule",
    "loader, capsule map, and disk references are bidirectionally equal",
    "OpenViking failure does not erase local success",
    "every external side effect has durable intent and an idempotency key",
    "uncertain side effects are reconciled before retry",
    "source pin changes stale affected completion evidence",
    "Phoenix LiveView is a required version-one product surface",
    "Docker Compose must boot the complete system",
    "multiple provider and model profiles may be active simultaneously",
    "one selected model owns each turn",
    "fallback occurs only for typed eligible failures",
    "runtime capacity changes do not require container restart",
